      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "int number = 12;\r\nint number1 = 5;\r\n\r\nint sum = number1 + number; // This will cause a compilation error due to duplicate variable declaration.\r\nSystem.out.print(\"the addition of \" +number+ \" and \" +number1+ \" is : \" + sum);",
